; Merlin, the old enchanter (.ai/merlin.md), in a look of his own (tools/art/player_merlin.py): the title
; screen's blue-robed figure is the player, the one the dark wizard missed. Eric, 2026-11-02: "merlin is perfect,
; as one that uses his magic to protect others." Playable once every chapter's boss has fallen on Default or
; harder (The King-Maker, id the_one_he_missed); outside the campaign gate, since he was never imprisoned. He opens
; on Orb of Ages, his alone (UnlockDefinition.ExclusiveTo): a ward drawn where he stands and the light on his
; staff ricocheting in it. His passive is Warding Hand: whatever touches him is thrown back.
